input\": tc.arguments,\n}));\n```\n\nToken metadata appears as a separate `\"event_msg\"` with `\"type\": \"token_count\"` when usage data is available.","tool_use_id":"toolu_017NGFFu4EvzowGU59FQw3N4","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","dirty_fingerprint":"bc65e878d80c1722a0adee9428cbf850f1d73e21ecfd82d0c4182876ebf93c10","head":"173cfc66bb28f4c20e474f522f197eeef0c627de","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e#agent:add0fb660669a74c5","parent":"claude-code:c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","seq":115},"id":"ev1-b1a5c5627029646465207c8bc1250b6da162a3a30f402c873f042ead4af02447","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-19T07:03:19.385Z","producer":{"session_id":"c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.215","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"add0fb660669a74c5","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"# Codex Rollout JSONL Writing Structure\n\n## Session Meta Fields\n\nThe `session_meta` line initializes a rollout with:\n\n```rust\nserde_json::json!({\n    \"type\": \"session_meta\",\n    \"timestamp\": now_iso,\n    \"payload\": {\n        \"id\": target_session_id,\n        \"session_id\": target_session_id,\n        \"cwd\": cwd,\n        \"timestamp\": now_iso,\n        \"originator\": \"casr\",\n        \"cli_version\": env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\"),\n        \"source\": \"cli\",\n        \"thread_source\": \"user\",\n        \"model_provider\": \"openai\",\n    }\n})\n```\n\nThe payload captures workspace context and metadata, with `\"id\"` and `\"session_id\"` both populated for version compatibility.\n\n## Response Item Variants\n\nThe code constructs different envelope types based on message role and content:\n\n*