eck is the nested loop over threads × search terms. Tried pre-indexing but hit issues with stale index after merges.\",\n48\t      \"failed_approaches\": [\n49\t        \"Built an in-memory inverted index on session start — worked for search but the index went stale after saveMemoryMerged() writes. Would need cache invalidation on every write path.\",\n50\t        \"Tried switching to a single combined regex with alternation (term1|term2|term3) — faster but broke phrase matching and returned false positives on partial word matches.\"\n51\t      ],\n52\t      \"handoff_summary\": \"The search bottleneck is in bin/mcp-server.js handleSearchThreads() around line 180. The current approach lowercases every field of every thread on each search call. A pre-computed search text per thread (built once on load, updated on write) would fix it without needing a full inverted index. The CLI search in bin/cli.js cmdThreads() has the same pattern and should get the same fix.\",\n53\t      \"related_session_ids\": [\n54\t        \"a9156cdf-f117-426f-8563-7fa8d18da62e\",\n55\t        \"a9156cdf-f117-426f-8563-7fa8d18da62e\",\n56\t        \"75c44351-f1a9-475a-8bea-622812eb5a46\",\n57\t        \"59f244b6-0be4-415a-87e4-98fb01572f85\"\n58\t      ],\n59\t      \"resume_chain\": [\n60\t        {\n61\t          \"session_id\": \"a9156cdf-f117-426f-8563-7fa8d18da62e\",\n62\t          \"tool\": \"copilot-cli\",\n63\t          \"started_at\": \"2026-04-14T00:35:59.527Z\",\n64\t          \"ended_at\": null,\n65\t          \"resumed_from\": \"demo-session-grant-search\"\n66\t        },\n67\t        {\n68\t          \"session_id\": \"a9156cdf-f117-426f-8563-7fa8d18da62e\",\n69\t          \"tool\": \"copilot-cli\",\n70\t          \"started_at\": \"2026-04-14T00:36:05.729Z\",\n71\t          \"ended_at\": null,\n72\t          \"resumed_from\": \"a9156cdf-f117-426f-8563-7fa8d18da62e\"\n73\t        },\n74\t        {\n75\t          \"session_id\": \"75c44351-f1a9-475a-8bea-622812eb5a46\",\n76\t      