e it running unconditionally or fully open to the world.\\n- [ ] Decide exposure mechanism — Tailscale is already installed, two real options:\\n  - **Tailscale Serve** — private to devices on the tailnet only; \\\"friends\\\" would need to be invited onto the tailnet (simplest, most secure, but not truly public)\\n  - **Tailscale Funnel** — actually publicly reachable over HTTPS from the open internet, no tailnet invite needed for friends, but wider exposure surface\\n- [ ] Decide access control — \\\"friends\\\" implies more than one external user; given DeepSeek V4 Flash inference is resource-heavy, probably wants an API key / allowlist rather than wide-open access.\\n- [ ] Make it conditional on AC power (\\\"periods when my laptop is plugged in\\\") — likely a `launchd` job (or a script triggered by `pmset -g batt` power-source changes) that starts `ds4-server` + the Tailscale Serve/Funnel when plugged in and stops them on battery, rather than running 24/7.\\n\",\"numLines\":53,\"startLine\":1,\"totalLines\":53}},\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"b132c7e4-3886-4905-9262-5c1b59807faa\",\"session_id\":\"b1dc7858-0692-4321-b14e-54c34e356029\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/evintunador\",\"sessionId\":\"b1dc7858-0692-4321-b14e-54c34e356029\",\"version\":\"2.1.212\",\"gitBranch\":\"HEAD\"}\n\n=== isSidechain true lines ===\n\n=== unique origin.kind values ===\n   5 human\n   1 task-notification"},"type":"user","userType":"external","uuid":"632787a2-e26c-4e7c-9f01-b765d589b863","version":"2.1.215"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-08-11T02:16:46.326Z","schema":"conversation-ledger/v1"}
