e) rather than erroring: missing gh, no auth, offline,\n    non-GitHub origin all mean weaker evidence, never a failed command.\n    cledger never touches credentials; gh resolves repo and auth itself,\n    bounded by a 10s timeout so a hung network call can't hang the CLI.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n src/forge/forge.ts  | 43 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n src/forge/github.ts | 86 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 129 insertions(+)\n\n=====695dad4=====\ncommit 695dad495717d748d2de4310f7b07c8b439fcb56\nAuthor: Evin Tunador <evintunador@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Jul 21 10:34:53 2026 -0700\n\n    Suggestion output names the commits that carry conversations\n    \n    Live testing surfaced the hazard: the confirm command lists every\n    branch commit newest-first, and trimming the wrong SHA silently drops\n    the one anchor the mapping exists to rescue. UnmatchedBranch now\n    carries the noted subset and the CLI prints it (\"keep these\") above\n    the confirm command, with the ordering stated.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n src/cli.ts                        | 10 ++++++++--\n src/reanchor.ts                   |  6 +++++-\n src/test/reanchor-suggest.test.ts |  2 ++\n 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","is_error":false,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RsnBgJ5PPXaUnLbiRSXhr9","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","dirty_fingerprint":"bc65e878d80c1722a0adee9428cbf850f1d73e21ecfd82d0c4182876ebf93c10","head":"173cfc66bb28f4c20e474f522f197eeef0c627de","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c#agent:a5c627b890fdc1883","parent":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c","seq":33},"id":"ev1-efae49c67c25630bd55bf3baf53e080a5586f26504edf9c648d7eb24ef6a85fa","kind":"conversation_turn","oc